    <h2 class="display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-5 leading-tight">One app instead of five browser tabs</h2>
    <p class="text-ink-60 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md">Most young jobseekers lose momentum switching between job boards, course sites, CV templates and strangers they message for advice. Vuka connects all of it, so each step leads into the next.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="divide-y divide-[rgba(16,21,31,0.12)] border-y border-ink-5">
    <article class="py-8 flex gap-5">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 flex-shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-navy flex items-center justify-center" aria-hidden="true">
