      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="display text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Opportunities that fit you</h3>
        <p class="text-ink-60 leading-relaxed">Internships, learnerships and entry-level roles from sources like Indeed, LinkedIn, Pnet, Graduates24 and municipal portals, ranked by how well they match your skills and location instead of by posting date. Every listing is checked for scam risk before it reaches you.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="py-8 flex gap-5">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 flex-shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-navy flex items-center justify-center" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z" fill="white" fill-opacity="0.3"/><path d="M12 2v20" stroke="#3EB489" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20V4H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 6.5z" fill="#3EB489" fill-opacity="0.55"/></svg>
