      <div>
        <h3 class="display text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Courses for skills employers ask for</h3>
        <p class="text-ink-60 leading-relaxed">Short, practical courses with direct links to Simplilearn, HackerRank, Coursera and Udemy, so you can close a skills gap and attach the certificate to your next application.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="py-8 flex gap-5">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 flex-shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-navy flex items-center justify-center" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z" fill="#F5A623" fill-opacity="0.9"/><path d="M14 2v6h6" fill="white" fill-opacity="0.4"/><path d="M9 13h6M9 17h6" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-opacity="0.75"/></svg>
