<section id="faq" class="bg-white border-y border-ink-5">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <h2 class="display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-10 leading-tight">Questions before you download</h2>
    <div class="divide-y divide-[rgba(16,21,31,0.12)] border-y border-ink-5">
      <details class="group py-5">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold rounded focus-ring on-paper">
          Does Vuka cost anything?
          <svg class="chev flex-shrink-0" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-ink-60 leading-relaxed mt-3">The app is free to download and use. The only paid extra is the optional CV building service at R150 once-off, for people who would rather have Vuka write it for them.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group py-5">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold rounded focus-ring on-paper">
          Where do the job listings come from?
          <svg class="chev flex-shrink-0" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-ink-60 leading-relaxed mt-3">Vuka pulls live listings from several South African job sources into one feed and checks each one for scam and legitimacy risk before showing it to you.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group py-5">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold rounded focus-ring on-paper">
          Do I need a CV before I start?
          <svg class="chev flex-shrink-0" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-ink-60 leading-relaxed mt-3">No. You can start with a few skills typed into your profile and build the CV inside the app using the example and checklist.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="group py-5">
